    ('appLockDisableBody', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', '关闭后，任何人打开 Lucent 都能无需密码查看你的笔记和任务。请输入当前密码以确认。', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'ロックを解除すると、Lucent を開いた人は誰でもパスワードなしでメモやタスクを見られます。確認のため現在のパスワードを入力してください。', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', '잠금을 끄면 Lucent를 여는 누구나 비밀번호 없이 메모와 할 일을 볼 수 있습니다. 확인을 위해 현재 비밀번호를 입력하세요.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.', 'Without the lock, anyone who opens Lucent can read your notes and tasks — no password required. Enter your current password to confirm.'),
    ('noRecoveryTitle', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', '在没有重置途径的情况下开启？', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'リセット手段なしでオンにしますか？', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', '재설정 방법 없이 켤까요?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?', 'Turn on without a way to reset it?'),
    ('noRecoveryBody', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', '没有安全问题就无法重置密码。如果忘记此密码，唯一能重新进入 Lucent 的方式就是清除所有数据——此设备上的每条笔记、任务、附件和会话都将被永久删除。包括应用本身在内，没有任何人能为你找回密码，因为它从未被存储在任何地方。', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'セキュリティの質問がないと、パスワードのリセット手段はありません。このパスワードを忘れた場合、Lucentに戻る唯一の方法は全データの消去です。この端末上のすべてのメモ・タスク・添付ファイル・会話が完全に削除されます。パスワードはどこにも保存されないため、アプリ自身を含め誰も復元できません。', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', '보안 질문이 없으면 비밀번호를 재설정할 수 없습니다. 이 비밀번호를 잊으면 Lucent로 돌아갈 유일한 방법은 전체 데이터 삭제뿐입니다. 이 기기의 모든 노트, 할 일, 첨부 파일, 대화가 영구적으로 삭제됩니다. 비밀번호는 어디에도 저장되지 않으므로 앱 자체를 포함해 누구도 복구해 줄 수 없습니다.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.', 'Without a security question there is no password reset. If you forget this password, the only way back into Lucent is to clear all data — every note, task, attachment and conversation on this device, permanently. Nobody, including the app itself, can recover it for you, because the password is never stored anywhere.'),
